# Only send files required by the Dockerfile.
*
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!src/**
# Build provenance is generated in-image from the CI argument, not host files.
src/moomoo_mcp/_build_identity.json
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
# Effective deployment snapshots contain credentials; keep them excluded even
# if the build allowlist above is broadened later.
.deploy-config*

!deploy/
!deploy/trust/
!deploy/trust/harden_ca.py
